==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Ancient Springs are recoverable items from defeated [[Guardian]]s. They are also sold by the travelling merchant [[Teli]] at the price of sixty [[Rupee]]s. They and all other [[Ancient Material]]s were made by the ancient [[Sheikah]] to use in their [[Ancient Technology]]. Ancient Springs float when placed in water and never lose tension, no matter how many times they are compressed.<ref name="Inventory"/>

The [[Ancient Oven]] at the [[Akkala Ancient Tech Lab]] requires Ancient Springs in order to make certain pieces of [[Ancient Soldier Gear]]. They also count as [[Monster Part]]s, so they can be used in a [[Cooking Pot]] to make [[Elixir]]s. They are also accepted at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] as an ingredient for [[Gray Dye]], or they can be sold to the [[Fang and Bone]] in exchange for [[Mon]].

Ancient Springs are required to upgrade the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]].

